      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "emailSubject",
              "value": "={{ $json.Subject || \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "name": "emailSender",
              "value": "={{ $json.From || \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "name": "emailBody",
              "value": "={{ (() => {\n  const part = ($json.payload.parts || []).filter(p => p.mimeType === \"text/plain\")[0];\n  return part ? $base64ToString(part.body.data) : ($json.snippet || \"\");\n})() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "name": "emailReceivedTime",
              "value": "={{ $json.internalDate }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dd54b7d4-dbe1-4145-8b22-b6f1305bb4ca",
      "name": "Prepare Email Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI assistant that analyzes emails to determine if they contain actionable tasks.\n\nGiven the email details below, output a JSON object with the following structure:\n\n{\n  \"is_actionable\": boolean,\n  \"task\": string,\n  \"deadline\": string | null,\n  \"priority\": \"High\" | \"Medium\" | \"Low\",\n  \"sender\": string,\n  \"subject\": string,\n  \"summary\": string\n}\n\nRules:\n- If the email is informational and does not require an action, set \"is_actionable\": false.\n- If \"is_actionable\": false, you can leave other fields empty or use default values.\n- If \"is_actionable\": true, extract:\n  - task: the actionable task description\n  - deadline: if a clear deadline is mentioned, use it; otherwise null\n  - priority: classify as High, Medium, or Low based on urgency and importance\n  - sender: the email sender\n  - subject: the email subject\n  - summary: a short summary of the email (maximum 2 sentences)\n- Do not invent deadlines or tasks.\n- Return valid JSON only.\n\nEmail Details:\n\nSubject: {{$json.emailSubject}}\nSender: {{$json.emailSender}}\nBody: {{$json.emailBody}}\nReceived: {{$json.emailReceivedTime}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a3df699-a75f-4401-ad0e-107036d7f4c8",
      "name": "AI Task Classifier",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "kz4ro90tLvVLpdu8",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2675206b-3e37-4604-ab41-939a5fbf0d55",
      "name": "Is Actionable?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        672,
